            "review_text": "PTimm\n80 contributions\n1\nGreat Seafood In Nha Trang\nApr 2025 • Family\nGreat, good value restaurant with lots of seafood in tanks. \n\nWe had eaten in Nha Trang a few nights ago. Food tends to arrive as it’s cooked, so we were expecting this. \n\nHowever, the service here is great. We chose two lobsters and a crab. Actually chose the creatures from the tanks! Lobster was £29 a kilo. Crab half that price. The staff helped extract every bit of delicious meat. Rice and noodles arrived separately and were delicious too. \n\nOverall, a great restaurant and recommended.\nRead more\nWritten April 19, 2025",
