            "review_title": "Review at Coral 3",
            "review_text": "Tom S\nGlasgow, United Kingdom139 contributions\n0\nVietnam 2025\nMar 2025 • Couples\nWe have been in Vietnam for 3 months, and this is by far the worst restaurant we have been in. My wife ordered tiger prawns in a garlic butter sauce with fried rice. What arrived was normal prawns in a sweet chilli sauce with boiled rice. When we complained, we were told the sweet chilli sauce had garlic in it. After several minutes whilst my meal got cold, they agreed to change it. As I ate my meal, we continued to ask about my wife's and were always told one minute. After 15 minutes, during which time 10 other diners had arrived and been served, my wife's meal hadn't arrived, so we asked for the bill, and I'm sure you've guessed they said my wife's meal would be one minute. We refused and paid for what I ate and the drinks. DO NOT GO HERE.\nRead more\nWritten March 27, 2025",
